        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1911 characters\">        &lt;p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1911 characters\">            Another tip is don&#8217;t forget to always document all your activities and keep the files organized as they will<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
