        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">&lt;p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            Keep up the exceptional work! Having a good score is a great start to being noticed by university<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            admission officers, it shows your dedication to studying hard and lets them know you are serious about<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            your academics and will definitely be when you sit in university!<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">        &lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">        &lt;p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            Continue to maintain that score, especially if you are aiming to go to UK and Asian universities, they<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            put more focus on your academic score as they are usually the main requirements in getting accepted; not<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            only your final score, but also required subjects that are related to the major that you apply to (HL<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1087 characters\">            subject in IBDP and A-Level subject in Cambridge A-Level.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
