        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">            &lt;li&gt;Start working on your profile branding by crafting a comprehensive portrayal of yourself that highlights<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">                your academic achievements, extracurricular activities, skills, experiences, and personal qualities.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">            &lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">            &lt;li&gt;Delve deeper and investigate potential career paths, fields of study, and hobbies that align with your<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">                interests. This can involve reading articles, watching documentaries, attending workshops or seminars,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">                and talking to professionals in various fields.&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2259 characters\">            &lt;li&gt;Be extra prepared by making curated university lists, that are realistic and tiered based on your<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
